-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §16 מורה המלמד בבית ספר יסודי לפי בסיס
-- משרה של חטיבת ביניים: a primary teacher whose position base the existing
-- agreements kept at the junior-high base (24 weekly hours a position), and
-- a new teacher in grades 7–9 of an eight- or nine-year primary school, are
-- employed on the primary teacher's week of §§14–15.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `16 מורה המלמד בבית ספר יסודי לפי בסיס משרה של חטיבת ביניים`

@ref akn:art_16
GIVEN `teaches in a primary school` IS A BOOLEAN
      `kept on the junior-high position base` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a new teacher in grades 7-9 of an 8- or 9-year primary school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed on the primary week under section 16` `teaches in a primary school` `kept on the junior-high position base` `a new teacher in grades 7-9 of an 8- or 9-year primary school` IF
        (`teaches in a primary school` AND `kept on the junior-high position base`)
    OR  `a new teacher in grades 7-9 of an 8- or 9-year primary school`

-- The base the existing agreements kept, as the clause recalls it.
`the junior-high position base, in weekly hours` MEANS 24

#ASSERT `employed on the primary week under section 16` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `employed on the primary week under section 16` FALSE FALSE TRUE
